#: ../../../dev/events.rst:2
msgid "Event API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:5
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:7
msgid ""
"Syncthing provides a simple long polling interface for exposing events from "
"the core utility towards a GUI. To receive events, see :doc:`/rest/events-"
"get`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:11
msgid "Event Structure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:13
msgid "Each event is represented by an object similar to the following::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:15
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    \"id\": 2,\n"
"    \"globalID\": 3,\n"
"    \"type\": \"DeviceConnected\",\n"
"    \"time\": \"2014-07-13T21:04:33.687836696+02:00\",\n"
"    \"data\": {\n"
"        \"addr\": \"172.16.32.25:22000\",\n"
"        \"id\": \"NFGKEKE-7Z6RTH7-I3PRZXS-DEJF3UJ-FRWJBFO-VBBTDND-4SGNGVZ-"
"QUQHJAG\"\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:26
msgid ""
"The top level keys ``id``, ``globalID``, ``time``, ``type`` and ``data`` are "
"always present, though ``data`` may be ``null``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:29
msgid "id"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:30
msgid ""
"A unique ID for this event on the events API. It always increases by 1: the "
"first event generated has id ``1``, the next has id ``2`` etc. If this "
"increases by more than 1, then one or more events have been skipped by the "
"events API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:33
msgid "globalID"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:34
msgid ""
"A global ID for this event, across the events API, the audit log, and any "
"other sources. It may increase by more than 1, but it will always be greater "
"than or equal to the id."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:37
msgid "time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:38
msgid "The time the event was generated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:39
msgid "type"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:40
msgid ""
"Indicates the type of (i.e. reason for) the event and is one of the event "
"types below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:42
msgid "data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:43
msgid ""
"An object containing optional extra information; the exact structure is "
"determined by the event type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/events.rst:49
msgid "Event Types"
msgstr ""
